	)
	(text "For the sense resistors and current sense amplifiers:\nA max current of 2.5A was selected to give some wiggle room for transients. \nThe INA4180A2 was selected for the higher 50 V/V gain as this is a relatively low current application. \nThe sense resistor was calculated using R_sense = Vout/(Imax*Gain) aiming for 2.5V max output, giving 20mOhm. \nPower dissipation on the resistor is P=I^2*R = 2.5^2 * .02 = 0.125W. 0.25W shunt resistor is appropriate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 275.336 29.718 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
